  "description": "Find the smallest subarray to remove such that the sum of the remaining elements is divisible by p.",
  "target": 6,
  "pseudocode": "1. target = sum(nums) % p\n2. if target == 0 return 0\n3. map = {0: -1}, curr = 0, res = n\n4. for i, val in enumerate(nums):\n5.   curr = (curr + val) % p\n6.   needed = (curr - target + p) % p\n7.   if needed in map: res = min(res, i - map[needed])\n8.   map[curr] = i\n9. return res if res < n else -1",
